 all logs -> [shadow mining L] -> [regression + frozen holdout L] -> scenarios
```

The belief updates from observed motion **and the ego action actually taken**. Prediction then queries that belief for each shortlisted ego manoeuvre. [Planner design](/Users/aditya/dev/sih2026-hq/research/P3-PLANNER.md)

